      "content": "okay i hear you on the aspirin. but i'm really worried because he's so out of it and i don't have any tylenol or motrin here right now. i really don't want to drive him all the way to the hospital if it's just a virus. if i only have the aspirin, how much would be a safe amount for a 6 year old to take just to break this fever? like i'd just give him a small dose so he can sleep.",
